ain light source and cool blue cyberpunk city light as secondary ambient lighting.\n\nImprove the artwork as if it is in the final polishing stage of a professional visual novel illustration.\n\nAdd stronger and cleaner cel-shaded shadows under the hat brim, collar, sleeves and mechanical arms.\n\nFocus on material rendering:\n\n- leather top hat with subtle specular highlights\n- metallic robotic arms with clean hard reflections\n- transparent wine glass with realistic glass highlights\n- glossy playing cards with slight reflected light\n- gold invitation card with elegant metallic reflections\n\nAdd subtle table reflections from candlelight and cards.\n\nImprove depth and readability while keeping the image mostly cel-shaded.\n\nAvoid messy shadows.\n\nAvoid excessive painterly rendering.\n\nAvoid over-detailing.\n\nAvoid redesigning any element.\n\nFocus on unified lighting, material definition and visual polish.\n\nThe final result should feel like a finished official game key visual.","isHtml":false,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9464},{"id":1781666546228,"text":"[圖片]","image":"[omitted: large string payload]","sender":"me","time":"11:24","timestamp":1781666649843,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9465},{"id":1781666546232,"text":"> 🏃 进度：25.0%","rawContent":"> 🏃 进度：25.0%","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:26","timestamp":1781666802064,"roundId":"round_1781666682897_yhb8kucte","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9476},{"id":1781666546233,"text":"> ✅ 绘图已完成","rawContent":"> ✅ 绘图已完成","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:26","timestamp":1781666803769,"roundId":"round_1781666682897_yhb8kucte","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-